<title>FRANCE: Alcatel Althsom wins $115 mln GSM orders.</title>
<headline>Alcatel Althsom wins $115 mln GSM orders.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alcatel Alsthom Cie Generale d'Electricite announced on Thursday that its mobile communications division had won three GSM (global system for mobile telecommunications) supply contracts worth a total of $115 million in China, the Philippines and Uzbekistan.</p>
<p>Under these contracts, Alcatel will supply GSM mobile communications infrastructure equipment including mobile switching equipment and base station controllers as well as associated services.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5542</p>
</text>
